3.4 Why manufacturing is the most credible beachhead

The business case is concrete and observable: quotes become orders, orders require material, material becomes work, work must pass quality checks, and delivered work must be billed. Each interface has a timestamp, owner and potential exception. This allows Aetheris to demonstrate a measurable before/after workflow rather than selling a general “AI transformation.” Manufacturing is also aligned with relevant operational vocabulary, but no founder experience substitutes for a documented customer result.

