Typical company: 35 knowledge workers, multiple client teams, leadership disagreements about what constitutes proof and when decisions are final. Trigger: reorganization, growth, new leadership cohort or persistent handoff friction. Will buy: a facilitated pilot linked to real team decisions, clear participant authorization and correction pathways. Won’t buy: covert employee scoring.

